      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:ap.138.monbeg",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲧⲟⲧⲉ ⲡⲉϫⲁϥ ⲙⲡⲓⲣⲱⲙⲓ ϫⲉⲥⲟⲩⲧⲉⲛ ⲧⲉⲕϫⲓϫ ⲉⲃⲟⲗ ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲁϥⲥⲟⲩⲧⲱⲛⲥ ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲁⲥ**ⲟⲩϫⲁⲓ** ⲙⲫⲣⲏϯ ⲛϯⲭⲉϯ .",
      "english": "Then he told the man, 'Stretch out your hand.' He stretched it out; and it was restored whole, just like the other.",
      "source": "01_Matthew_12",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.matt.bohairic:12",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "**ⲟⲩϫⲁⲓ** ϩⲙⲡϫⲟⲉⲓⲥ",
      "english": "(Be) safe in God.",
